/// VM function declarations for Frame timestamp observation
/// Implemented in crates/auto-lang/src/ui/frame_bench.rs (9918/9919 固定位，
/// NATIVE_ID_ENTRIES 钉扎——register_vm_declarations 按 MAP 取固定 ID)
///
/// PLAN-716 Phase 2 (供⑨-a)：返回型 int（i32 lane）——原 i64 声明驱动
/// 2 槽消费路径，.at 值流三断（下游 plan-022 实录）。值域=进程单调毫秒，
/// <2^31（i32 封顶 ≈24.8 天进程存活；saturating 截断，SD-B 注记面）。

/// Frame-begin timestamp (monotonic ms; 0 = not captured)
#[vm]
fn begin_ms() int

/// Frame-present timestamp (monotonic ms; 0 = not captured)
#[vm]
fn present_ms() int
